        <mxCell id="G7W9DclJnyzfWvnpklfE-1" parent="d0k3w_6dgV7-3BdLsU98-16" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h3&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;How It Works:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt; 1. Inside Firecracker microVM:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt; • Xvfb :0 -screen 0 1920x1080x24 - creates virtual display in RAM&lt;br&gt; • DISPLAY=:0 chromium-browser - browser renders to virtual display&lt;br&gt; • x11vnc -display :0 -forever - streams display over VNC&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt; 2. On Host:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt; • VNC viewer connects and shows the browser&lt;br&gt; • User interacts (mouse/keyboard)&lt;br&gt; • VNC sends inputs back to browser&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="500" x="672.9300000000001" y="1460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d0k3w_6dgV7-3BdLsU98-18" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="2762.5" width="1440" x="2610" y="3520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="G7W9DclJnyzfWvnpklfE-139" parent="d0k3w_6dgV7-3BdLsU98-18" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;Data Flow:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. User launches isolated browser via UI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;2. Firecracker creates microVM with guest OS + browser&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;3. User browses web; all activity contained in microVM&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;4. File operations monitored in real-time by daemon&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;5. Events logged and analyzed by host-side engine&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6. Threats detected trigger alerts and blocks&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;7. Safe files can be transferred to host after scan&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="670" x="770.0000000000001" y="2342.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
